  <section class="pom-testimonials" data-pom-region="prayer-testimonials">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-testimonials-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
          <h2>Stories of faith<br>and hope.</h2>
          <div class="pom-quote-nav">
            <button class="pom-icon-btn is-prev" type="button" data-quote="prev" aria-label="Previous story"><span class="pom-arrow"></span></button>
            <button class="pom-icon-btn is-next" type="button" data-quote="next" aria-label="Next story"><span class="pom-arrow"></span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-quote-wrap" data-quotes>
        <blockquote class="pom-quote is-active">
          <div class="pom-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>Two years ago, I was diagnosed with a degenerative back condition causing severe sciatic pain. I was taking Tylenol every 6 hours and was referred to a pain specialist. One day while in the hospital for a pacemaker, a nurse asked when I had surgery — I said I didn’t have surgery on my back. She said she could see scars on my back. Another nurse confirmed it. Then I realized I was overdue for my pain shot and I didn’t feel any pain. Praise God — He healed me supernaturally. I haven’t needed a shot since December 2025, and I don’t have any pain in my back. I give God all of the praise.</p>
          <cite>— God healed my back supernaturally</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="pom-quote">
          <div class="pom-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
          <p>In 1982 I was attacked by a hijacker. When I refused to give him my keys, he hit me over the head with a bottle and tried to kill me. As I was struggling, I saw an angel who spoke to me and said “not today,” and the hijacker left. During the struggle the car ran over my foot and it became paralyzed. After many years of walking with a paralyzed foot that affected my hip, in 2026 the pain became toxic. Doctors overmedicated me and I had a seizure. I was home alone, and because I’m diabetic, it meant my death in a short time. When I didn’t respond to my prayer warrior’s call, she knew something was wrong. She called the fire station; they found me dead, rushed me to the hospital, and brought me back to life. We give God praise for the miracle!</p>
          <cite>— God raised me from the dead and healed me</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="prayer-testimonials" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-faq" data-pom-region="prayer-faq">
    <div class="pom-fallback">
      <div class="pom-faq-intro"><div><p class="pom-eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>A few helpful<br>answers.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="pom-faq-list" data-accordion>
        <div class="pom-faq-item is-open">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="true">Can I request prayer for someone else? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Yes. You can share a request without including private details.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-faq-item">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I connect with the ministry? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Yes. Reach out by phone or email, or use the contact form below. We welcome you into local fellowship and online gatherings.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-faq-item">
          <button class="pom-faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I join prayer online? <span class="pom-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="pom-faq-a">Yes. Join Saturday Night Live on Zoom for preaching, music, and prayer with Pastor Michael Vance.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="prayer-faq" columns="12" /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pom-contact is-crowd" id="get-in-touch">
    <div class="pom-contact-layout">
      <div class="pom-contact-copy" data-pom-region="prayer-contact-copy">
        <div class="pom-fallback">
          <p class="pom-eyebrow">Get in Touch</p>
          <h2>We’d love to hear from you.</h2>
          <p class="pom-contact-lead">Have a question, need prayer, or want to help?</p>
          <div class="pom-contact-meta is-icons">
            <a href="tel:3305059087">330 505-9087 <span class="pom-meta-icon is-phone" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
            <a href="mailto:terryolivia@currently.com">terryolivia@currently.com <span class="pom-meta-icon is-mail" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pom-cms"><squarespace:block-field id="prayer-contact-copy" columns="12" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pom-form-card" data-pom-region="prayer-contact-form">
        <div class="pom-fallback">
          <p class="pom-form-cms-hint">Edit this page → click here → add a <strong>Form</strong> block to receive messages by email.</p>
